---
import GlassCard from "./GlassCard.astro";
import { numUniqueLanguages } from "../data/translators";
---

<GlassCard class="gc-small-gap">
  <h2>About iloader</h2>
  <p>
    iloader is a free, open-source, cross-platform iOS sideloading companion
    designed to make installing SideStore and other IPA apps as easy as
    possible.
  </p>
  <div>
    <hr />
    <h3>Features</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Automatically installs and sets up <a
          href="https://docs.sidestore.io"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer">SideStore</a
        > or LiveContainer+SideStore
      </li>
      <li>Get helpful, intelligent fixes and suggestions for common errors</li>
      <li>Install any IPA application</li>
      <li>Localized into {numUniqueLanguages + 1 /* English */} languages</li>
      <li>
        Place RPPairing and Lockdown Pairing files into apps like StikDebug or
        Protokolle
      </li>
      <li>Connect to devices wirelessly or via USB</li>
    </ul>
    <p>And more!</p>
  </div>
  <p>
    If you're curious about how iloader works, check out the <a
      href="#technical-details">technical details</a
    > section.
  </p>
  <div>
    <hr />
    <p class="disclaimer">
      iloader is designed to be safe and unlikely to cause issues, but we are
      not responsible for damage to devices, data, or Apple accounts. We are not
      responsible for any misuse of iloader; please ensure compliance with all
      applicable laws and regulations.
    </p>
    <hr />
    <p class="disclaimer">
      Here and <a
        href="https://github.com/nab138/iloader"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer">the GitHub repository</a
      > are the only places iloader is officially distributed. Do not download iloader
      from any other sources. iloader will always be free to download and will never
      sell apps or certificates. If you encounter a site selling iloader or its services,
      it is not official and likely a scam.
    </p>
    <hr />
    <div class="sponsor-section">
      <a
        class="button sponsor-button"
        href="https://github.com/sponsors/nab138"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        <img src="/heart.svg" alt="Heart Icon" class="button-image" />
        Sponsor
      </a>
      <p>
        Enjoying iloader? Please consider sponsoring! It helps support
        development and keep the project free for everyone.
      </p>
    </div>
    <hr />
  </div>
  <div class="buttons">
    <a
      class="button"
      href="https://github.com/nab138/iloader"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noreferrer"
    >
      <img src="/GitHub.webp" alt="GitHub logo" class="button-image" />
      GitHub
    </a>
    <a
      class="button"
      href="https://github.com/nab138/iloader/issues"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noreferrer"
      ><img src="/bug-solid-full.svg" alt="Bug icon" class="button-image" /> Report
      a Bug</a
    >
    <a
      class="button"
      href="https://docs.sidestore.io/docs/installation/prerequisites"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noreferrer"
    >
      <img src="/SideStore.webp" alt="SideStore logo" class="button-image" />
      SideStore Guide
    </a>
    <a
      class="button"
      href="https://github.com/nab138/iloader-website"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noreferrer"
      ><img
        src="/file-code-regular-full.svg"
        alt="File icon"
        class="button-image"
      />Website Source</a
    >
    <a
      class="button"
      href="https://nabdev.me"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noreferrer"
      aria-label="nabdev portfolio"
    >
      <img
        src="/nabdev.webp"
        alt="nabdev logo"
        class="button-image portfolio-plug"
      />
      See my other projects!
    </a>
  </div>
</GlassCard>
